# Coverage ≥ 90%

Minimum **90%** line/branch coverage on `app/` is mandatory.

## Enforcement

- `pyproject.toml` → `[tool.coverage.report] fail_under = 90`
- Local: `make coverage` or `make tests` with cov flags
- **pre-commit** runs coverage and **blocks the commit** if below 90%
- CI must keep the same threshold

## When adding features

- Ship tests in the same change
- Prefer unit tests for new logic; mock LLM SDKs — no paid API calls in hooks/CI
- Do not lower `fail_under` without an explicit product decision

## Do not

- Commit with failing coverage
- Exclude large modules from coverage to fake the metric
